	<sprite string_id="railpolyp:odoriparent" name="Movement Controller - Dancing [UNFINISHED]" notes="This sprite inherits RailPolyParent (Path controller), so to use this you just need to use a path-controllable sprite. This also works with the two path-pivotal-rotation controllers aswell.">
